    "_docStill": "Thrown into still water (a lake, a pond, a deep pool, the sea: water too deep to stand in): no current, it floats where it landed, bobbing (restDays.still, then it sinks). At sea the ocean current takes it (seaSpeed: cells an hour on the street map; restDays.sea: then it is carried off and lost).",
    "seaSpeed": 4,
    "flotsam": {
